# A man alone at his station or his post, now and then, to himself.

== brand_block
place: chop
cast: A = name(Brand)
cooldown: 2m
A [murmurs]: Come on, you knotted bastard.

== tam_sleeptalk
place: sleep
cast: A = name(Tam)
cooldown: 3m
A [murmurs]: No, mother... not the eels...

== solo_sit_1
place: sit
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: My backside's gone to sleep.

== solo_sit_2
place: sit
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Best seat in the yard, this.

== solo_sit_3
place: sit
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: If I sit any closer I'll catch light.

== solo_sit_4
place: sit
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Wood's damp. It spits.

== solo_sit_5
place: sit
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Another hour. Just another hour.

== solo_sit_6
place: sit
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Gods, the smoke gets in everything.

== solo_sit_7
place: sit
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Somebody should put more on that.

== solo_sit_8
place: sit
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: I could sit here till spring.

== solo_eat_1
place: eat
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Cold again. Always cold.

== solo_eat_2
place: eat
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: There's more gristle than meat in this.

== solo_eat_3
place: eat
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Could do with some salt.

== solo_eat_4
place: eat
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Cook's outdone himself. Outdone himself badly.

== solo_eat_5
place: eat
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Bread's hard as a door.

== solo_eat_6
place: eat
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: One more bowl. Just one.

== solo_eat_7
place: eat
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Mm. Not bad. Not good, but not bad.

== solo_eat_8
place: eat
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: I'll dream of pie tonight.

== solo_sleep_1
place: sleep
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: No... not the eels...

== solo_sleep_2
place: sleep
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Five more minutes, mother.

== solo_sleep_3
place: sleep
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Mm. Pie.

== solo_sleep_4
place: sleep
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: I'll pay you back... I swear...

== solo_sleep_5
place: sleep
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Who's there? ...Nobody.

== solo_sleep_6
place: sleep
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: The bells... stop the bells...

== solo_sleep_7
place: sleep
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Warm. So warm.

== solo_sleep_8
place: sleep
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Not my watch... not yet...

== solo_rummage_1
place: rummage
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Where's the damned lamp oil...

== solo_rummage_2
place: rummage
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Who's been at the salt pork?

== solo_rummage_3
place: rummage
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Candles, candles... not a one left.

== solo_rummage_4
place: rummage
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: This was full on Tuesday.

== solo_rummage_5
place: rummage
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Rope. Rope. More rope. No oil.

== solo_rummage_6
place: rummage
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Somebody's been in here. Somebody always has.

== solo_rummage_7
place: rummage
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: I'll have to write it down again.

== solo_rummage_8
place: rummage
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Moths. Wonderful.

== solo_carry_1
place: carry
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Heavy. What's in these, stones?

== solo_carry_2
place: carry
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Four more. Then four more after that.

== solo_carry_3
place: carry
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: My back. Gods, my back.

== solo_carry_4
place: carry
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Why is it always me?

== solo_carry_5
place: carry
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Careful... careful...

== solo_carry_6
place: carry
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: If I drop this I'm done for.

== solo_carry_7
place: carry
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Two weeks in and I'm a mule.

== solo_carry_8
place: carry
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Nearly there. Nearly.

== solo_chop_1
place: chop
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Come on, you knotted thing.

== solo_chop_2
place: chop
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Split, damn you.

== solo_chop_3
place: chop
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: There. And there.

== solo_chop_4
place: chop
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Harder than the last one.

== solo_chop_5
place: chop
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Ha. Clean through.

== solo_chop_6
place: chop
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: This one's got iron in it.

== solo_chop_7
place: chop
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Blisters. Every night, blisters.

== solo_chop_8
place: chop
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: One more stack. Then a drink.

== solo_lean_1
place: lean
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Quiet out there.

== solo_lean_2
place: lean
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Nothing moving. Good.

== solo_lean_3
place: lean
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Lean long enough, you grow into the wall.

== solo_lean_4
place: lean
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Wind's turned.

== solo_aldous_1
cast: A = name(Aldous)
cooldown: 5m
A: My knees. Oh, my knees.

== solo_aldous_2
cast: A = name(Aldous)
cooldown: 5m
A: Thirty years of stairs.

== solo_aldous_3
cast: A = name(Aldous)
cooldown: 5m
A: Glass that looks at the moon. Unnatural, that is.

== solo_aldous_4
cast: A = name(Aldous)
cooldown: 5m
A: In my day we had a bell and a stick.

== solo_aldous_5
cast: A = name(Aldous)
cooldown: 5m
A: Young captain. Young ideas.

== solo_aldous_6
cast: A = name(Aldous)
cooldown: 5m
A: Nothing out there. Never is, till there is.

== solo_wat_1
cast: A = name(Wat)
cooldown: 5m
A [murmurs]: Oh, the eel-wife of the Low Bridge...

== solo_wat_2
cast: A = name(Wat)
cooldown: 5m
A [murmurs]: She had a crooked leg, and a crookeder smile...

== solo_wat_3
cast: A = name(Wat)
cooldown: 5m
A [murmurs]: Down by the water, where the lanterns drown...

== solo_wat_4
cast: A = name(Wat)
cooldown: 5m
A [murmurs]: Tra-la, the bargeman's daughter...

== solo_wat_5
cast: A = name(Wat)
cooldown: 5m
A: Wonder what's in the store tonight.

== solo_wat_6
cast: A = name(Wat)
cooldown: 5m
A: Lamp oil fetches a good price in the Lower Town.

== solo_hendrik_1
cast: A = name(Hendrik)
cooldown: 5m
A: She'll mend. They always mend.

== solo_hendrik_2
cast: A = name(Hendrik)
cooldown: 5m
A: Silver. Always silver.

== solo_hendrik_3
cast: A = name(Hendrik)
cooldown: 5m
A: I should have been a baker.

== solo_hendrik_4
cast: A = name(Hendrik)
cooldown: 5m
A: Round and round. Round and round.

== solo_hendrik_5
cast: A = name(Hendrik)
cooldown: 5m
A: Keep your eyes open, Hendrik.

== solo_jory_1
cast: A = name(Jory)
cooldown: 5m
A: South. Where it's warm.

== solo_jory_2
cast: A = name(Jory)
cooldown: 5m
A: She laughed at my joke. She actually laughed.

== solo_jory_3
cast: A = name(Jory)
cooldown: 5m
A: Two more months and I'm gone.

== solo_jory_4
cast: A = name(Jory)
cooldown: 5m
A: Cold post, this. Coldest in the yard.

== solo_jory_5
cast: A = name(Jory)
cooldown: 5m
A: Wonder if she's thinking of me.

== solo_mirelle_1
cast: A = name(Mirelle)
cooldown: 5m
A: Idlers. The lot of them.

== solo_mirelle_2
cast: A = name(Mirelle)
cooldown: 5m
A: The glass stays where it is.

== solo_mirelle_3
cast: A = name(Mirelle)
cooldown: 5m
A: Two men short and a wall to watch.

== solo_mirelle_4
cast: A = name(Mirelle)
cooldown: 5m
A: Tomorrow I'll have the roster changed.

== solo_mirelle_5
cast: A = name(Mirelle)
cooldown: 5m
A: Not one of them would last a week in the south.

== solo_osric_1
cast: A = name(Osric)
cooldown: 5m
A: Mother would have a fit if she saw this place.

== solo_osric_2
cast: A = name(Osric)
cooldown: 5m
A: Keep your head down, Jory.

== solo_osric_3
cast: A = name(Osric)
cooldown: 5m
A: Warm bed. One day.

== solo_osric_4
cast: A = name(Osric)
cooldown: 5m
A: I'll write her tomorrow.

== solo_cold_1
when: cold
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Cold enough to crack teeth.

== solo_cold_2
when: cold
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Can't feel my fingers.

== solo_cold_3
when: cold
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: My breath's freezing.

== solo_cold_4
when: cold
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Winter's coming early.

== solo_cold_5
when: cold
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Wish I'd brought the other cloak.

== solo_night_1
when: night:late|dawn
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Dawn can't come soon enough.

== solo_night_2
when: night:late|dawn
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: How long till the bells?

== solo_night_3
when: night:late|dawn
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Longest night of my life. Every night.

== solo_night_4
when: night:late|dawn
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Half asleep on my feet.

== solo_uneasy_1
when: uneasy
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A [whispers]: What was that?

== solo_uneasy_2
when: uneasy
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A [whispers]: Just the wind. Just the wind.

== solo_uneasy_3
when: uneasy
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A [whispers]: I don't like this.

== solo_uneasy_4
when: uneasy
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A [whispers]: Somebody's out there.

== solo_uneasy_5
when: uneasy
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A [whispers]: Stay sharp. Stay sharp.

== solo_at_ease_1
when: at_ease
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Quiet. Too quiet.

== solo_at_ease_2
when: at_ease
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Another night, another penny.

== solo_at_ease_3
when: at_ease
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Gods, I'm bored.

== solo_at_ease_4
when: at_ease
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Hm.

== solo_at_ease_5
when: at_ease
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Could murder a pie.

== solo_at_ease_6
when: at_ease
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Wonder what the captain's writing up there.

== solo_at_ease_7
when: at_ease
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Should've been a sailor.

== solo_at_ease_8
when: at_ease
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: One day I'll have my own house. With a door that shuts.

== solo_at_ease_9
when: at_ease
cast: A = any
cooldown: 5m
A: The canal's high tonight.
